  <History Date="08-11-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Volux Flaris Blade (identical.  no pixel layout)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="29-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Flash Butrym ART BarFX 800 IP65 (hopeless documentation. effectively identical.  channel names are vague.  function ranges are either missing or don't make any sense)" Version="2" />
